# --- committed generated evidence ---
# These files are intentionally tracked: tests.py asserts exact counts against
# the family datasets, measurements are part of the recorded evidence, and
# certs/ is used by the checker smoke test. Uncommenting any entry below changes
# that reproducibility contract and may make a fresh clone fail tests until the
# corresponding generators have been run.
#
# family_compositions_results.json
# family_eisenstein_results.json
# family_sparse_results.json
# measurements.json
# certs/
